WEBVTT

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:18.920
What the hell are you doing?

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.750
Keep your filthy hands off!

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.540
It's not a kind country we live in, is it?

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.500
Lord O'Reilly is renting a room in this building.

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:11.330
He has been meeting with someone in secret,
and our objective is to find out who.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:12.540
Surveillance, then.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.380
We're not going to tail him?

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:17.630
We're most likely dealing with another spy.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.830
There's a good chance that spy would spot us.

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:24.130
Anyone going in or out of that building
has to take the path in front of the park.

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:25.250
Ange, I want you there.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:27.830
As for the other post,

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.210
we've rented our own room here, across from his.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.750
We can see into Lord O'Reilly's room from there.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:34.210
Then who will...

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:35.170
I will!

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.000
No.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:38.460
Why not?

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.630
Stakeouts can go on for days.

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:44.420
If the Princess disappears for that long,
people will suspect something.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:48.290
Then you can be me in the meantime.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.290
I'll be keeping watch at the park.

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:53.920
But it won't be for 24 hours every day, will it?

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.380
Well, we would trade off at night.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:03.250
I've had official business nonstop for days;
it's been so suffocating.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:07.630
When you're a princess,
sometimes you just need to get outside.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.330
Surely, you would understand that, Ange?

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:17.040
If you promise not to take
a single step outside your post.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.500
Alright!

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:23.960
That was hardly fair, putting it like that.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:29.460
Why do you think Miss Ange
has such a soft spot for Her Highness?

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.710
No idea.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.580
Maybe she just can't say no
to someone with her own face.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.380
Honestly! I'm asking a serious question!

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.880
It's her again.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.710
You ruddy brat!

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:09.380
Don't come from behind. Come from the front.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:13.210
It's possible to create blind spots
from in FRONT of your marks, too.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.040
And that's why you're teaching her how to pick pockets?

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.420
I only taught her a way to survive.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:30.750
It's very hard, having to go without food.
It puts you in a dark place.

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:36.500
Doesn't it bring back memories, trading clothes like this?

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.210
Of teasing Mrs. Crawford?

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.710
Yes! Remember how much fun it was?

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.170
And our private fashion shows.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:48.130
You taught me how to jump rope.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.880
And I learned piano!

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.750
We played duets together.

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.080
But we could never get on the same page.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:59.420
But that was the most fun I'd ever had, playing the piano.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:04.420
You know, I've been meaning to ask you.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:06.670
What?

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:10.130
Why do you call me "Princess"?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.710
That's the custom on the Black Lizard Planet.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.500
Give me a real answer!

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.750
Don't worry.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.460
I don't mean it sarcastically.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.710
Then why?

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:26.380
It's simply out of respect.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.580
It is chilly.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.710
Thank you.

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.420
For what?

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:50.000
When I came from the front, it worked.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.380
Nice arrangement.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.710
I'm Julie. What's your name?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.040
Chloe.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:11.750
Hey, Chloe.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:12.960
What?

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:15.790
Tell me more about the Black Lizard Planet.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:18.750
You like stories, don't you?

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.290
Uh-huh. Your stories are so good!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.540
Would you like to hear about the flying whales?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.170
Or The Man who Turned into a Box?

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:30.040
There's no royalty on the Black Lizard Planet, is there?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.790
And no poor people like me?

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:35.710
Then it must be a great planet to live on!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:40.630
Alright, today I'll tell you about
the Princess and the Pickpocket.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:44.420
It happened far, far away...

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.500
Even farther than the New World.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.960
On the Black Lizard Planet.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:54.040
Once upon a time, there lived a little Princess.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.460
Princess Charlotte!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.790
It's no use trying to run from us!

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.580
Come out and show yourself!

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:09.750
Etiquette and manners, language and music.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:14.580
Horseback riding, dance, history, literature, art.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:16.420
All she ever did was study.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:20.580
The Princess had grown to despise her life at the palace.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.250
Outside!

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:42.670
The girl across the wall looked just like the Princess.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:55.630
The girl started to come
through the wall to visit every day.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.330
Hey, Your Highness.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.670
Let's be friends!

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.080
I'm rather a dull girl.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:14.170
I don't think you would like my friendship.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.130
No, I would!

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:20.000
Why?

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:23.000
Because we're complete opposites.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.750
They played, they laughed...

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.290
They traded places, they pulled practical jokes.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:41.460
It was the first friend the Princess had ever had.

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:48.040
One day, the Princess asked the girl
if she would trade places with her.

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:50.960
She wanted to see what life was like outside the palace.

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:56.250
Her heart soared at the prospect of seeing a new world.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.960
No one would notice her.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:01.210
No one would ask anything of her.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.630
That is exactly what the Princess wanted.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:26.540
Ange!

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.420
Oi! Ange!

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.670
Little brat, why haven't you done your job?

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:33.630
Job?

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:35.380
Don't play dumb with me!

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.830
You've been slacking off again!

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:41.170
It'll be another night with no dinner for you!

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:45.040
If you want to fill your belly,
you'll do your job tomorrow!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:51.080
Look! Princess got the highest score again!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.210
Of course she did!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.290
Horseback riding, dance, and piano, too!

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.000
I wish I could be like her!

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:08.210
Thank you for waiting.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:11.330
If I don't practice every day, I'll lose my touch.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:14.500
Piano, dance, language, history.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.750
You are a hard worker.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.420
You are worthy of my respect.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:21.830
You work hard, too, Miss Chise.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.460
I can carry on because I enjoy it.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:27.130
With you, that does not seem to be the case.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.580
Do I look bored?

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.250
You appear as one punishing herself.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:34.040
You see right through me.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.040
I'll have to train harder.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.250
It's because I'm empty.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:47.750
That's why I have to build such a thick exterior.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:54.790
That's her.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:02.960
That's Ange's signal.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.250
Alright.

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:08.960
I can't make out her face with that on.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.920
It's no use, Miss Dorothy!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:17.130
She won't take the veil off; I can't read her lips!

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.420
It's risky, but I guess we'll have to tail her
until we can figure out who she is.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:35.960
Ow ow ow ow!

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:37.670
You chose the wrong pocket to pick.

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.830
She was so strong...

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.580
For such an elegant lady.

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:53.170
Lord O'Reilly was meeting with Gazelle.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.250
One of the Duke of Normandy's spies.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.460
You know what they all look like?

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.460
That's normal on the Black Lizard Planet.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:03.790
Where are you going, Miss Ange?

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.670
To destroy the evidence.

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:12.170
Look, I ain't doing this 'cause I want to!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:13.920
You need discipline!

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:17.750
You need to get it into your head
that you have to work harder!

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:21.000
What do you say?

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.670
Thank you very much, Sir!

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:27.790
I am blessed to be able to work
under such a benevolent master.

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:29.380
Very good.

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:31.380
Don't forget that you feel that way.

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.290
Wh-who are you?!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.880
How did you get in here?!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.420
Just a passing alien from the Black Lizard Planet.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:41.790
I fight for justice.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:44.830
Who do you think you are,
barging into other people's houses?!

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:47.290
I am providing for these children!

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:48.880
Providing for?

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.790
I think they're the ones providing for you.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:53.250
Don't you talk back to me!

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.210
Wow.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:00.290
With just one hand?

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.630
P-p-put me down! Put me down!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:03.880
If you insist.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.670
That's what you asked for.

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.210
Y-you little...

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.000
That was incredible!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.630
You're really strong!

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:23.920
How did you do that?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.000
But...

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.500
He'll be back for revenge.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:32.460
When the master is in a bad mood,
he takes it out on us.

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:34.130
So I'm sure he'll...

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.290
A letter of introduction.

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.830
There's an orphanage on Stanford Hill.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.330
Go there for help.

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:46.330
Why are you doing all this for me?

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:50.880
You went after the woman in the black veil,
like I asked, remember?

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:54.000
But I messed it up.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:56.500
No, you gave me what I needed.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:59.290
Wait!

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.290
Um... Er... I...

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:07.920
In the story! What happened to the Pickpocket girl?

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:14.960
On the day they switched places,
a revolution broke out.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.420
Down with the monarchy!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.830
Down with the monarchy!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.210
Damn you and your lives of luxury!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.040
Off with the royals' heads!

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.250
The switched princess ran as fast as she could.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.330
Ange! Please be safe!

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.460
Ange!

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:41.920
Charlotte!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:42.880
Ange!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.380
I'm so glad you're not hurt!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.500
You, too!

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.250
Fire!

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:50.630
Let's get out of here!

00:15:57.630 --> 00:15:58.500
Ange.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.130
I'm going to be Queen.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.460
What?

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:06.630
When I traded places with you, I learned something.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:10.540
There are all kinds of walls, keeping everyone apart.

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:13.040
I'm going to be Queen,

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:15.250
and break those walls down.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:17.500
And then, Ange,

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.540
we can be together forever!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.130
That's a beautiful dream.

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:24.670
It's not a dream!

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.920
I'll make it come true.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.290
I promise.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:29.580
So...

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.380
Charlotte!

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:50.460
Charlotte...

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:52.290
Your Highness!

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.830
Are you alright, Your Highness?

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:58.040
Wait, I'm not her. I'm not the Princess!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.040
You've had quite the scare, haven't you?

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:04.250
You don't need to hide who you are from us.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.460
I promise, we'll keep you safe.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.880
Wait! Listen to me!

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:10.710
The real princess fell down there!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.670
Charlotte! Charlotte!

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:19.880
And from then on, neither of them could ever go back.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:27.750
That poor Princess.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:31.710
No, the one you should feel sorry for is the Pickpocket.

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:33.670
Why?

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:36.000
She got to be a princess!

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:40.080
The Princess and the Pickpocket were switched
in the chaos of the revolution.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:43.540
What do you think would happen
if the royal family found out?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:47.210
We should mobilize the Army immediately
and crush those rebels!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:50.040
I heard the Army has betrayed us!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:53.330
This is why I was against
letting commoners into the military.

00:17:53.830 --> 00:18:00.330
She was surrounded by a bunch of bloodthirsty adults,
and forced to fend for herself.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:03.670
If she didn't play the role of princess perfectly,
they would kill her.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:07.580
She would have been working extremely hard,
under intense pressure.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:11.250
Etiquette, manners, language,

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:13.790
music, horseback riding, dance, history,

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.880
literature, art.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:17.960
She had so much to learn.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.920
The slightest misstep
would lead her directly to the gallows.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:33.170
And under that kind of pressure,
she did it all flawlessly.

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:44.330
This girl who couldn't even read or write
mastered nine languages.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.580
She'd never seen a musical score in her life,

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:51.130
but now she has a reputation
as one of the Kingdom's leading pianists.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.710
And all that

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:03.170
came from her agonizing effort.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.080
A magnificent performance, Princess.

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:40.290
Thank you, Lord O'Reilly.

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:44.420
By the way, how is Inspector Flint doing?

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:50.130
The woman you've been meeting
in your room by the park.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:20:02.420
Inspector Flint works for the Duke of Normandy.
Her talk of defection is a trap.

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:08.710
Are you saying that I should turn myself in, Princess?

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.130
Not at all.

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.540
You don't need to rely on them.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:16.710
If you like, I could do you the favor
of getting you across the Wall.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:21.420
Princess, who ARE you?

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.830
Just a spy.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:50.040
It's beautiful every time I hear it.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.750
You taught me how to play, Charlotte.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:56.460
You surpassed my skill ages ago.

00:20:56.710 --> 00:20:58.670
I was desperate, that's all.

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:01.420
I had no knowledge, no refinement, nothing.

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:03.960
I was empty.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:05.250
No.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:11.830
When I finally found you,
I said we should run away together.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.170
But...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:19.540
You said you would change the country.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.710
Just as I once wished to do.

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:27.960
You are a real princess now.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:34.040
Thank you.

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:37.500
That means so much, coming from you.

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:40.040
And I'm sorry.

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:42.630
For forcing that role onto you.

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:49.580
I know! It's been so long... let's do one together!

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:52.580
I'm not good enough.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:56.330
The first time you played with me, I was a beginner.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.830
Do you remember what you said?

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:05.330
"I've never had so much fun playing the piano before."

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:06.330
Mm-hm!
